Goal:
  (and (at-curb-num car_00 curb_0) (at-curb-num car_01 curb_1) (at-curb-num car_02 curb_2) (at-curb-num car_03 curb_3) (at-curb-num car_04 curb_4) (at-curb-num car_05 curb_5) (at-curb-num car_06 curb_6) (at-curb-num car_07 curb_7) (at-curb-num car_08 curb_8) (at-curb-num car_09 curb_9) (behind-car car_10 car_00) (behind-car car_11 car_01) (behind-car car_12 car_02) (behind-car car_13 car_03) (behind-car car_14 car_04) (behind-car car_15 car_05) (behind-car car_16 car_06) (behind-car car_17 car_07))
Metric:
