Pred prop:
  (at-curb car): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (at-curb-num car curb): in_init in_pre in_goal in_eff
  (behind-car car car): in_init in_pre in_goal in_eff
  (car-clear car): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (curb-clear curb): in_pre in_eff
Func prop:
  (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
Global prop:
  action_cost_func:(total-cost)
  has_int_action_cost_func
